<title>HUNGARY: Garagent '96 pre-tax profit HUF 27.1 mln.</title>
<headline>Garagent '96 pre-tax profit HUF 27.1 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year 1996, ending December 31.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of forints unless stated)</p>
<p>					Jan-Dec 1996   Jan-Dec 1995</p>
<p>    Operating profit		47.1	 vs    91.0</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		  27.1	 vs    77.5</p>
<p>    Net sales			861.7	 vs   847.1</p>
<p>    Other revenue		   21.5	 vs    17.1</p>
<p>    Direct cost of sales	 692.7	  vs   644.4</p>
<p>    Indirect cost of sales     128.9	  vs   121.5</p>
<p>    Other expenditures	    14.6	  vs     7.3</p>
<p>    Net financial income	  20.1 loss   vs    13.5 loss</p>
<p>	Financial revenue	   45.8	  vs    58.4</p>
<p>	Financial expenditure     65.9	  vs    71.9</p>
<p>NOTE - GarAgent Garazsipari Kereskedelmi Rt is a garage service company.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom+36 1 327-4040</p>
</text>
